        },
        {
          "document_id": "01a013b2a4037d758e5b0b17c20553a4",
          "score": 0.757426381111145,
          "text": "Sobe (sister of Saint Anne)\nThe 19th-century mystic Anne Catherine Emmerich claims that according to her visions (which give a detailed genealogy of Mary), Sobe was a sister of Anne, but the mother of Elizabeth was Emerentia, Sobe and Anne's maternal aunt.",
