        {
          "document_id": "01a013b565dd77389465b3a148c0df4c",
          "score": 0.5956751108169556,
          "text": "Power Henry Le Poer Trench\nPower Henry Le Poer Trench (11 May 1841 – 30 April 1899) was a British diplomat.Trench was the son of William Thomas Le Poer Trench, 3rd Earl of Clancarty and Lady Sarah Juliana Butler.",
