          "document_id": "01a013b6af5d7c68a6e870914ccbffec",
          "score": 0.5509566068649292,
          "text": "Milaim Rama\nRama was born in Viti, SFR Yugoslavia to Kosovo Albanian parents from the village Zhiti near Viti. At the age of 17, he immigrated to Switzerland and in 2003 received the Swiss passport. Rama is the father of Kosovo international Alketa Rama.",
          "source_hops": [
