        {
          "document_id": "01a013b91d217577a3163f2dd9486b4a",
          "score": 0.7293853759765625,
          "text": "Archibald Acheson, 2nd Earl of Gosford\nArchibald Acheson, 2nd Earl of Gosford,  (1 August 1776 – 27 March 1849), styled The Honourable Archibald Acheson from 1790 to 1806 and Lord Acheson from 1806 to 1807, was a British politician who served as Lieutenant-Governor of Lower Canada and Governor General of British North America in the 19th century.",
          "source_hops": [
