          "text": "Fantasy (George Michael song)\n\"Fantasy\" is a song by the English singer-songwriter George Michael. It was first released in 1990 as the B-side of his single \"Waiting for That Day\" (and \"Freedom! '90\" in the US). On 7 September 2017, a new version reworked by Nile Rodgers was released as a single from Listen Without Prejudice / MTV Unplugged (2017). The single was released posthumously, more than eight months after Michael's death on 25 December 2016.",
