        {
          "document_id": "01a013bad65075a4869dd81feb5f3312",
          "score": 0.6714861989021301,
          "text": "Kamures Kadın\nKamures Kadın (Ottoman Turkish: کامرس قادین; meaning \"Bringer of pleasure\"; called also Gamres, Kamres or Kamus Kadın; 5 March 1855 – 30 April 1921) was the first and chief consort of Sultan Mehmed V of the Ottoman Empire.",
