        },
        {
          "document_id": "01a013c3cbea7ee99730df9bb8f27f62",
          "score": 0.6341205835342407,
          "text": "Keōpūolani\nKeōpūolani was among the highest aliʻi of all the islands of Hawaiʻi in her days, a ranking called naha. This meant she was the product of a royal half-sister and brother marriage.",
