          "document_id": "01a013c75ebf7b1aa01644a5f058f64f",
          "score": 0.6579055190086365,
          "text": "Frederick Cleveland Morgan\nFrederick Cleveland Morgan D.C.L. LL. D (also known as F. C. Morgan, F. Cleveland Morgan and informally as Cleve Morgan) (1 December 1881 – 3 October 1962) was a Canadian department store heir, art collector, museum manager, and philanthropist.",
