        {
          "document_id": "01a013ccd53c71be8ba688baa74a79df",
          "score": 0.6214389801025391,
          "text": "Carrie Watson Fleming\nCaroline Margaret Watson Fleming (1844–1931) was the wife of former Governor of West Virginia Aretas B. Fleming and served as that state's First Lady from 1890 to 1893.",
