        {
          "document_id": "01a013d0465d7c958735309979e84683",
          "score": 0.7110791206359863,
          "text": "Charles Willoughby, 2nd Baron Willoughby of Parham\nCharles Willoughby, born about 1536/7, was the only son of William Willoughby, 1st Baron Willoughby of Parham, Suffolk, and his first wife, Elizabeth Heneage, daughter and heir of Sir Thomas Heneage of Hainton, Lincolnshire, by Katherine Skipwith, daughter of Sir John Skipwith of Ormsby.",
