          "score": 0.6864241361618042,
          "text": "Charles Willoughby, 10th Baron Willoughby of Parham\nCharles Willoughby, 10th Baron Willoughby of Parham died without issue and left his estate to his niece Elizabeth, who had married James Bertie, 1st Earl of Abingdon.",
