        },
        {
          "document_id": "01a013d0461a759eb159635691a35325",
          "score": 0.6633937954902649,
          "text": "Charles Willoughby, 2nd Baron Willoughby of Parham\nCharles Willoughby, 2nd Baron Willoughby of Parham (c.1536/7 – d. 1610–12) was the only son of William Willoughby, 1st Baron Willoughby of Parham, and Elizabeth Heneage.",
          "source_hops": [
