          "score": 0.6150730848312378,
          "text": "Lady Magdalene's\nThe film won three film-festival awards: \"Best Cutting Edge Film\" at the 2008 San Diego Film Festival, \"Audience Choice -- Feature-Length Narrative Film\" at the 2008 Cinema City International Film Festival held on the Universal Hollywood Citywalk, and \"Special Jury Prize for Libertarian Ideals\" at the 2011 Anthem Film Festival/FreedomFest held at Bally's Las Vegas.",
