          "document_id": "01a0177fbb7872459e2b56d19666cfed",
          "score": 0.6316921710968018,
          "text": "Francisco Giner de los Ríos\nFrancisco Giner de los Ríos (10 October 1839 in Ronda, Spain – 18 February 1915 in Madrid) was a philosopher, educator and one of the most influential Spanish intellectuals at the end of the 19th and the beginning of the 20th century.",
