        {
          "document_id": "01a01786828f7b53ad61f5ba7c7176bc",
          "score": 0.6729370951652527,
          "text": "List of Back to the Future characters\nJennifer Jane Parker (portrayed by Claudia Wells in the first film and voiced by her in Back to the Future: The Game, Elisabeth Shue in the second and third film, voiced by Cathy Cavadini in the animated series) is dating Marty McFly. In 2015 as seen in Back to the Future Part II, they are married.",
