        {
          "document_id": "01a017ab492f762183fa31ad72f19e65",
          "score": 0.4690619707107544,
          "text": "Zhu Qinan\nHis best result in 50 m Rifle is a bronze medal from the 2004 Asian Championships. Zhu is 5'11\" tall and weighs 148 pounds. At the 51st ISSF World Championship held in Granada, Spain, Zhu got gold medal in 50m Rifle 3 Positions.",
          "source_hops": [
