        {
          "document_id": "01a017ab491675458c84ee2534ddf090",
          "score": 0.4554094076156616,
          "text": "Zhu Qinan\nOn September 22, 2011, Zhu shot a perfect 600 in the qualification round. He scored 103.8 in the final round making a total score of 703.8 to gain the 10 m Air Rifle final world record.",
          "source_hops": [
