          "document_id": "01a017c4fef67b9686fb638659812c0a",
          "score": 0.6999801397323608,
          "text": "Psycho Donuts\nPsycho Donuts is a donut shop in Campbell, California opened in March 2009. The theme of the shop is \"craziness\"; it specializes in unusual donut flavors and many of its donuts' names are puns on mental illnesses or other mental health conditions, and the store's decorations include a straitjacket and a padded cell. In 2016, a third location in Santa Clara, California was opened, which along with the second location in Downtown San Jose, has closed. In 2021 A pop up location in the Valley Fair mall was opened and it still currently operating.",
