        },
        {
          "document_id": "01a013f644027d47aff5a2a625daa84c",
          "score": 0.5295780301094055,
          "text": "Alfred A. Marcus\nFollowing the Three Mile Island nuclear power incident, he also became involved in the work carried out by the Nuclear Regulatory Commission on the organization and management of nuclear power plants. Marcus has written many academic articles relating to organizational safety in publications like the Academy of Management Journal, the Strategic Management Journal, and Organization Science.",
