          "document_id": "01a013fea73b7a97989e8a7a61e57496",
          "score": 0.7263250350952148,
          "text": "Jolyon James\nOther recent works by Jolyon include Trapper and A Cautionary Tales for Children starring Virginia Gay. As a visual artist Jolyon has exhibited regularly in Victoria and was a finalist in the National Photographic Portrait Prize in 2012. He performed the role of the Moonshadow in Cat Stevens's musical of the same name which is played in Melbourne’s Princess Theatre for 12 weeks from 31 May 2012.",
          "source_hops": [
