          "score": 0.7602385878562927,
          "text": "Erik Watts\nErik Watts (born December 19, 1967) is an American semi-retired professional wrestler. He is best known for his appearances with World Championship Wrestling and the World Wrestling Federation in the 1990s. He is the son of wrestler Bill Watts.",
          "source_hops": [
