          "score": 0.7127015590667725,
          "text": "Don Holmes\nDonald Shane Holmes (born 5 January 1959) is a former Australian rules footballer who was played in the West Australian Football League (WAFL) for Swan Districts and in the Victorian Football League (VFL) for West Coast.",
