        },
        {
          "document_id": "01a01415a8197f5d9362de0fcc0a2249",
          "score": 0.5383796691894531,
          "text": "Umina Beach, New South Wales\nUmina Beach ( you-MY-nə) is a suburb within the Central Coast Council local government area on the Central Coast of New South Wales, Australia. Umina Beach is situated 85 kilometres (53 mi) north of Sydney and 111 kilometres (69 mi) south of Newcastle.",
