        {
          "document_id": "01a014244a3d7acf8ad0c32f4314ffb6",
          "score": 0.6803575158119202,
          "text": "Udhayam NH4\nThe soundtrack album was composed by G. V. Prakash Kumar. The music rights were acquired by Sony Music India. On Valentine's day, the track \"Yaaro Ivan\" was unveiled at Suryan FM. Actor Siddharth sang the Telugu version of this song.",
          "source_hops": [
