          "score": 0.45287269353866577,
          "text": "Kevin Yorn\nYorn became a deputy district attorney in L.A. County after graduating from Tulane Law in 1990. He was in the D.A.’s office for five years, working in the Hardcore Gang Investigations Unit.",
