          "text": "Jim Miller (punter)\nJames Gordon Miller (born July 5, 1957) is a former American college and professional football player who was a punter in the National Football League (NFL) for eight seasons during the 1980s.  Miller played college football for the University of Mississippi, and received All-American honors.  He played professionally for the San Francisco 49ers, Dallas Cowboys, and New York Giants of the NFL.",
