        {
          "document_id": "01a0143001a37c75b4e3bb139bde728b",
          "score": 0.602877140045166,
          "text": "John Jett\nJohn Jett (born November 11, 1968) is a former American football punter in the National Football League (NFL) for the Dallas Cowboys and the Detroit Lions. He played college football for East Carolina University. Jett won two Super Bowl rings with the Cowboys in Super Bowl XXVIII and Super Bowl XXX.",
