          "text": "Danny White\nWilford Daniel White (born February 9, 1952) is an American former professional football player and coach. He played as a quarterback and punter for the Dallas Cowboys in the National Football League (NFL). He later coached in the Arena Football League (AFL). He has been the color commentator for Cowboys games on Compass Media Networks' America's Team Radio Network since the 2011 season. He played college football at Arizona State University.",
