      "qid": "multifieldqa_zh:3186f38ef6828f69341f07dfd8e5fa9df391d518b84793f3",
      "question": "在过去五年中，邯郸市的生产总值有多少增长？",
      "answer_gold_docs": [
        "01a0143fec5d7dc5998a3975a3577acb"
      ],
      "bridge_gold_docs": [],
      "hop_gold_docs": [
        [
